    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nInterested in this property? Sign up for mySherryFitz to arrange your viewing, see current offers or make your own offer. Register now at SherryFitz.ie.\n\nSherry FitzGerald Conor McManus are pleased to bring to the market Drumsheeney, Threemilehouse, Co. Monaghan. \n\nAn attractive four-bedroom detached bungalow enjoying a peaceful rural setting.\n\nThe property occupies a generous site surrounded by mature, beautifully maintained gardens which provide a wonderful sense of privacy. Established trees, hedging, lawns and colourful planting create an appealing setting around the residence, while a spacious brick-paved driveway provides ample private parking. To the rear is a useful range of outbuildings, offering excellent storage and additional potential.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, sitting room, kitchen, four bedrooms, (one room ensuite), together with a separate shower room/WC. \n\nThe grounds are a particularly attractive feature of the property, combining carefully tended formal gardens around the house with a larger area of mature grounds to the rear. The property's rural surroundings offer peace and privacy while retaining convenient access to Threemilehouse, Monaghan town and surrounding amenities.\n\nDrumsheeney offers an excellent opportunity for those seeking a detached countryside home with generous outdoor space, mature gardens and useful outbuildings in a pleasant Co. Monaghan setting.\n\nViewing by appointment only with the agent."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nLiving Room: - \nA bright and well-proportioned living room featuring wooden flooring, an open fireplace and built-in storage, with a large window providing plenty of natural light and a pleasant garden outlook.\n\nKitchen Dining Room: - \nA spacious kitchen/dining room fitted with a range of solid units, ample worktop space and tiled flooring. The generous dining area provides plenty of room for family dining, with natural light overlooking the gardens.\n\nBedroom 1: - \nA comfortable and well-proportioned double bedroom featuring extensive built-in wardrobes, wood-effect flooring and a window providing natural light and a pleasant outlook.\n\nEn-Suite: - \nA spacious ensuite with tiled flooring, a generous walk-in shower area, WC and wash hand basin, complemented by a window providing natural light.\n\nBedroom 2: - \nGenerous double bedroom with an extensive range of built-in wardrobes and storage, finished with wood-effect flooring and overlooking the garden.\n\nBedroom 3: - \nBright double bedroom with built-in wardrobes providing excellent storage and a window overlooking the garden.\n\nBedroom 4: - \nBright single bedroom with window overlooking the surrounding countryside.\n\nShower Room: - \nWell-appointed bathroom comprising a shower enclosure, pedestal wash hand basin and WC, with tiled finishes and natural light.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Total floor area: 101 sq. mts. / ( 1087 sq ft ) approximately</li><li>Site area: 0.63 HA ( 1.56 acres ) approximately</li><li>Attractive four-bedroom detached bungalow</li><li>Set on a slightly elevated site in a pleasant rural setting</li><li>Generous mature gardens with established trees, hedging and planting</li><li>Spacious brick-paved driveway providing ample off-street parking</li><li>Useful detached outbuildings/garage</li><li>Peaceful countryside location within easy reach of Threemilehouse and Monaghan town</li><li>Oil-fired central heating</li><li>Broadband available</ul>"
      },
